        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Ateneo de Davao University, Society of Jesus, University of Rochester\n- Places: Davao City, Philippines\n- Topics: university structure, schools, interdisciplinary programs\n\nFacts:\n- Ateneo de Davao University is a private teaching, service, and research university in Davao City in the Philippines.\n- The Society of Jesus runs Ateneo de Davao University.\n- Ateneo de Davao University has five undergraduate schools: the School of Arts and Sciences, School of Business and Governance, School of Engineering and Architecture, School of Education, and the School of Nursing.\n- Ateneo de Davao University also operates a grade school and a high school.\n- The University of Rochester has six schools and various interdisciplinary programs.",
